  lines:
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: "Atomic Assembly is active. Helium-4 is now craftable \u2014 two protons,
      two neutrons, two electrons. It sells for twenty entropy: four times hydrogen,
      for roughly four times the inputs."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 1
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: Lithium, Carbon, Oxygen, Silicon, and Iron are also available in the recipe
      panel. Each one is more complex and more valuable. Start with Helium-4 and
      scale up from there.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
